{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the delicious universe of Kitchen Delights! Put your culinary skills to the test by becoming a chef in a restaurant or burger joint. Explore different game modes and challenge yourself to create delicious dishes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806800/extras/519a18323c0d7f91f0fd4cedc58791ec.poster.avif?t=1760351721\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806800/extras/519a18323c0d7f91f0fd4cedc58791ec.webm?t=1760351721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806800/extras/519a18323c0d7f91f0fd4cedc58791ec.mp4?t=1760351721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Path</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to be a chef in an elegant restaurant or make your way to fame in a burger joint. The decision is yours!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Service</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver dishes directly to tables or to the counter for delivery orders.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star Challenge</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work hard to achieve the coveted 4-star rating. With every perfect dish and exemplary service, you get closer to the prestige of becoming a culinary reference.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2806800?t=1760351721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2806800?t=1760351721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806800/e29fdd0653